@startuml
title UML State Machine Diagram

[*] --> R1 : [create new account]

state R1 <<choice>>
state R2 <<choice>>
state R3 <<choice>>

R1 --> R2 : [validate registration]
R2 --> R3 : [log in upon successful registration]

state R3 <<choice>>
state R4 <<choice>>

R3 --> R4 : [check ticket status]

state R4 <<choice>>
state R5 <<choice>>

R4 --> R5 : [book and confirm ticket, make payment]

state R5 <<choice>>
state R6 <<choice>>

R5 --> R6 : [edit or delete account details]

state R6 <<choice>>
state R7 <<choice>>

R3 --> R7 : [log out after completing any action]
@enduml
